      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'it is an addictive game where the player has to feed the tiger what he
    wants. If the player doesn''t guess what the tiger wants, he will get angry and
    take away one of the player''s hearts. If the player loses all hearts, he will
    lose.

    The game has a progression between levels, where each subsequent level
    becomes more and more difficult. After feeding the tiger in each level, the player
    receives stars and a score based on the number of hearts he saves.

    Each
    level is different from the previous one in that the conveyor belt with food
    for the tiger moves faster and faster, and the tiger''s demands increase and
    increase. The player must be fast and accurate to guess what the tiger wants
    and feed it on time to save their hearts and keep completing the levels.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f82c516754c0414469b62bc7a7cd06eb, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1273205576025229485, guid: f82c516754c0414469b62bc7a7cd06eb, type: 2}
